sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Source as Adobe or SAP source
    participant Orbital as Orbital / Taxi
    participant Bridge as Python bridge
    participant Rabbit as RabbitMQ topic exchange
    participant QueueA as Target queue A
    participant QueueB as Target queue B
    participant TargetA as SAP inbox or Adobe stub
    participant TargetB as FWT stub

    Source->>Orbital: Submit customer-account update
    Orbital->>Orbital: Resolve reusable facts and project target model
    Orbital->>Bridge: HTTP request plus lineage metadata
    Bridge->>Bridge: Validate metadata and adapt JSON/XML structurally
    Bridge->>Rabbit: Persistent mandatory publish with confirm
    Rabbit-->>Bridge: Broker confirms routable publication
    Bridge-->>Orbital: 202 Accepted
    par Independent target copy
        Rabbit->>QueueA: Route by source pattern
        QueueA->>Bridge: Deliver with manual acknowledgement
        Bridge->>Orbital: Invoke route-specific saved query
        Orbital->>TargetA: Write projected target request
        TargetA-->>Orbital: 2xx
        Bridge->>QueueA: ACK
    and Independent FWT copy
        Rabbit->>QueueB: Route by source pattern
        QueueB->>Bridge: Deliver with manual acknowledgement
        Bridge->>Orbital: Invoke shared FWT saved query
        Orbital->>TargetB: POST projected FWT request
        TargetB-->>Orbital: 2xx
        Bridge->>QueueB: ACK
    end
    Note over QueueA,QueueB: A failed branch is rejected without requeue and dead-lettered independently.
